WEBVTT

00:05:28.366 --> 00:05:31.243
So on and off like that for five years.

00:05:31.243 --> 00:05:34.163
When I was 13 years old in India,

00:05:34.205 --> 00:05:37.208
there's traditional three-year
retreat going to start.

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:41.212
I thought I should join this
because it's good for my laziness.

00:05:41.587 --> 00:05:42.755
And I join.

00:05:43.172 --> 00:05:46.008
The first month, wonderful, no lazy.

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:47.718
Second month, lazy come back.

00:05:47.718 --> 00:05:48.928
(Laughter)

00:05:48.969 --> 00:05:50.137
Now what happened?

00:05:50.137 --> 00:05:53.099
My lazy and my panic,
they two become good friends.

00:05:53.099 --> 00:05:54.350
(Laughter)

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:57.478
The life in the retreat becomes disaster.

00:05:58.354 --> 00:05:59.897
And I thought I should leave.

00:05:59.939 --> 00:06:01.440
But I feel embarrassed to leave